00:01:01,968 --> 00:01:04,557
Number one is the Lincoln Blackwood.

32
00:01:04,737 --> 00:01:06,300
In two thousand two,

33
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:08,566
Lincoln, Ford's luxury brand,

34
00:01:08,566 --> 00:01:11,145
decided to build a luxury pickup.

