00:04:41,945 --> 00:04:43,291
For a niche vehicle,

131
00:04:43,291 --> 00:04:44,638
that is not nothing.

132
00:04:44,818 --> 00:04:47,286
But for a full production model from

133
00:04:47,286 --> 00:04:49,823
General Motors, it was far below what

134
00:04:49,823 --> 00:04:50,577
