159
00:05:43,471 --> 00:05:45,688
Number three is the Subaru Baja.

160
00:05:45,868 --> 00:05:48,335
Subaru took its Outback wagon,

161
00:05:48,335 --> 00:05:50,719
cut off the back of the roof,

162
00:05:50,719 --> 00:05:52,939
and added a small open bed.

163
00:05:53,119 --> 00:05:55,037
It had all-wheel drive,

164
00:05:55,037 --> 00:05:56,372
a car-like ride,

165
00:05:56,372 --> 00:05:57,623
and four doors.

166
00:05:57,803 --> 00:05:59,770
It was sold in the United States

167
00:05:59,770 --> 00:06:02,167
from two thousand three to two thousand

168
00:06:02,167 --> 00:06:02,412
six.

169
00:06:02,592 --> 00:06:04,893
Subaru had tried this idea before,

170
00:06:04,893 --> 00:06:07,262
with the BRAT in the late seventies

171
00:06:07,262 --> 00:06:08,142
and eighties.

172
00:06:08,492 --> 00:06:10,612
The Baja was too small to be

173
00:06:10,612 --> 00:06:12,657
