202
00:07:10,451 --> 00:07:12,597
and its bed was designed to be

203
00:07:12,597 --> 00:07:12,954
used.

204
00:07:13,134 --> 00:07:15,384
The Baja was priced like a premium

205
00:07:15,384 --> 00:07:15,781
wagon.

206
00:07:15,961 --> 00:07:18,360
The lesson: being early with a good

207
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:20,485
