209
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,750
Number four is the Nissan Titan.

210
00:07:25,930 --> 00:07:27,335
It was not a weird truck.

211
00:07:27,515 --> 00:07:29,977
It was a serious full-size pickup,

212
00:07:29,977 --> 00:07:32,875
