It never broke through.

220
00:07:48,688 --> 00:07:50,681
According to Motor Authority,

221
00:07:50,681 --> 00:07:53,224
Titan sales in the United States were

222
00:07:53,224 --> 00:07:56,385
just fifteen thousand and sixty-three units in

