227
00:08:06,329 --> 00:08:09,046
thousand trucks in twenty twenty-five.

228
00:08:09,226 --> 00:08:11,425
The Titan was selling in a week

229
00:08:11,425 --> 00:08:14,050
what Ford sometimes sells in a single

230
00:08:14,050 --> 00:08:14,334
day.

